{"src":"ht","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":239100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ht","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10292.344387000001,"text":"se yon chemen ki ka mennen lanmò fizik oubyen lanmò etènèl men lanmò sa kòmanse avan lè sa"},{"kind":"text","t":10658.445896000001,"text":"It is a path that can lead to physical death or eternal death, but this death begins before then."},{"kind":"audio","t":10719.000203000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10723.752976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10728.863924000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":10733.893603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10739.206088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":10739.736561,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":18810.389872,"text":"wa moutre yo lòt bondye se yè a bay ansanm ak sa li mande yo pou yo fè"},{"kind":"text","t":19136.064772,"text":"You showed them the other gods yesterday, along with what he asked them to do."},{"kind":"audio","t":19189.216663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19194.308751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":19199.770114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19205.03728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":19205.359055,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":30726.718438,"text":"men ki jan pou nou lapriyè"},{"kind":"text","t":30861.067245000002,"text":"but how we should pray"},{"kind":"audio","t":30911.818189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30913.040062,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":38473.791261,"text":"papa nou ki nan syèl la nou mande pou yo toujou respekte non ou"},{"kind":"text","t":38731.346181,"text":"Our Father in heaven, we ask that your name always be honored"},{"kind":"audio","t":38784.783328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38789.987334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38795.393018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":38796.438423,"samples":13296,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":50554.268654,"text":"pèp payisyen konstitisyon an ban m chay pou m kenbe drapol espwa nou nan fè leta a mache kòm sadwa"},{"kind":"text","t":51049.985336,"text":"Haitian people, the constitution gives me the responsibility to hold up the flag of our hope in making the state function as it should."},{"kind":"audio","t":51112.614484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":51118.088366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51123.464021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51128.707917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51133.756895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51139.152599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51142.478883,"samples":24792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":66769.755242,"text":"li ba yon moun don pou l ka pale langaj li ba yon lòt don pou l ka esplike sa pawòl langaj la vle di"},{"kind":"text","t":67346.499953,"text":"It gives one person the gift of being able to speak a language, and it gives another the gift of being able to explain what the words of that language mean."},{"kind":"audio","t":67434.473652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67436.650172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67439.014559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67441.210667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67443.726802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67445.98466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67448.432366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":67448.807491,"samples":14224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":78360.796042,"text":"sa se yon pawòl ki vre si yon moun dèyè yon pozisyon pou l dirije nan legliz li dèyè yon bèl travay"},{"kind":"text","t":78771.963146,"text":"This is a true statement; if someone holds a leadership position in the church, they have a beautiful job."},{"kind":"audio","t":78824.45828400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78827.607099,"samples":22432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"audio","t":78860.905419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78866.341612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78871.466749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78876.018505,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":83526.988995,"text":"avèk bèl sentiwon pase nan"},{"kind":"text","t":83665.570745,"text":"with beautiful feelings passing through"},{"kind":"audio","t":83717.625479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83723.082502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":83723.373618,"samples":5264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95851.792824,"text":"ach konpran deja ton òdinateur on a enh makintocha lamizon"},{"kind":"text","t":96096.00289,"text":"I already understand, your computer has been marked at home."},{"kind":"audio","t":96151.282938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96156.525084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96161.79789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":96163.1675,"samples":13896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":102426.403819,"text":"ou an an se vit fè sa an an"},{"kind":"text","t":102604.228904,"text":"You just need to do that quickly."},{"kind":"audio","t":102644.604123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102649.246127,"samples":31432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":115130.652391,"text":"alòske tout moun konnen se jis gaston oba li menm k'ap finanse epi dirije sètenn gwoup atoufè"},{"kind":"text","t":115484.143211,"text":"even though everyone knows it's just Gaston Oba himself who is financing and leading certain groups around"},{"kind":"audio","t":115547.077991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115552.274958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115557.324756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115562.563762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115567.787488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":115569.597193,"samples":15560,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":124963.315216,"text":"se konsa pitit fi jefte a ansanm ak zanmi l yo ale nan mòn"},{"kind":"text","t":125304.193385,"text":"That is how Jephthah's daughter and her friends went into the mountains."},{"kind":"audio","t":125362.599419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125368.018532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125373.244179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":125373.695752,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131196.617348,"text":"i al kriye paske li tapral mouri tifi"},{"kind":"text","t":131442.878245,"text":"And she cried because she was about to die, girl."},{"kind":"audio","t":131485.975845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131491.149782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131493.745026,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":141830.360654,"text":"nan yon ti gwoup pa gen sans pou lide a preche ak yon estil tradisyonèl nan kanpe deyè yon gwo chè"},{"kind":"text","t":142262.352764,"text":"In a small group, there is no sense in preaching the idea in a traditional style while standing behind a large pulpit."},{"kind":"audio","t":142342.234754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":142347.692257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142353.11104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142358.244428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":142363.557992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142369.023355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":142369.323791,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":149538.753203,"text":"mouche estime gen anpil bagay li kache pèp la pa konnan"},{"kind":"text","t":149863.270083,"text":"Mouche believes there are many things he is hiding that the people do not know."},{"kind":"audio","t":149909.981082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149915.420006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149920.949957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149925.965666,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":155889.605332,"text":"al kontre moun ki swav glo yo pou ba yo bwè"},{"kind":"text","t":156167.63405,"text":"On the contrary, he lures people in to give them a drink."},{"kind":"audio","t":156226.249151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":156231.585345,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156236.856301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":156237.190136,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":167017.587198,"text":"yon atis ki konn fè tablo deklare li p ap patisipe nan yon aktivite ki pral sèvi enterè lòt moun"},{"kind":"text","t":167449.894573,"text":"An artist who knows how to paint declares that he will not participate in an activity that will serve the interests of others."},{"kind":"audio","t":167528.179986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167533.416822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167538.584939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167543.912654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167549.11244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":167554.563263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":167555.183244,"samples":9792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":176216.92509,"text":"ya l chèche patiraj pou mouton yo tou pre lavil gèdo sou boso lè leve nan fon kote lavil la ye a"},{"kind":"text","t":176781.86858,"text":"They are looking for grazing land for their sheep near the city of Gèdo, on the slopes at dawn, in the valley where the city is located."},{"kind":"audio","t":176856.628963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176861.859659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176867.172024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":176872.106844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176877.234251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176882.621685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176885.0788,"samples":19392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":190413.566165,"text":"li te gen avèk a a tout lanm pa la anzanm ak sòlda tou lòt nasyon ak lòt ras li te soumèt anba pouvwa li"},{"kind":"text","t":190842.769665,"text":"He had all the love there together with soldiers of every other nation and other races he had submitted under his power."},{"kind":"audio","t":190904.739109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190906.406215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190907.953273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190909.468902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190911.09630900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":190912.657077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":190912.924363,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":204361.224842,"text":"li louvri twal tant lan sou kay la epi li mete twati tant lan anwo l jan seyè a te ba li lòd fè a"},{"kind":"text","t":204819.282233,"text":"He opened the tent cloth over the house and placed the tent roof above him just as the lord had ordered him to do."},{"kind":"audio","t":204865.914314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204867.395333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":204868.898802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204870.43934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":204872.109496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204873.145452,"samples":28760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":214605.411197,"text":"orite lajistis minisman fouben sak responsab fè plak ak inspeksyon machin responsab fatra"},{"kind":"text","t":215015.527957,"text":"The justice auditor, the cunning minister responsible for license plates and vehicle inspections, and the person responsible for waste."},{"kind":"audio","t":215077.968544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215083.546765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215088.82021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215094.145025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215099.529119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215105.591093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":215108.829487,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":222769.062148,"text":"dariyich deside chwazi san vanprefè li mete chèf nan tout peyi a"},{"kind":"text","t":223097.102328,"text":"The poor man decided to choose without preference, appointing a chief for the entire country."},{"kind":"audio","t":223157.905908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":223163.632847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":223169.05364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":223174.75032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":223177.751257,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":233800.37908,"text":"prezidan biwo elektoral depatmentala jan batis lisyen joli bois te demand ti information sa"},{"kind":"text","t":234251.292092,"text":"The president of the departmental electoral office, Jan Batis Lisyen, asked Joli Bois for this small piece of information."},{"kind":"audio","t":234315.002361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":234320.618832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":234325.973396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":234331.427439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":234336.955741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":234342.337845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":234345.104486,"samples":19992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"close","t":249205.952887,"code":1005}]}